at lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"title":"Swami","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/swami","kind":"symbol","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami"}}}